Z||000009||Ken Wittlief||06-14-2001||11:03 AM||||I have seen red vettes with white roofs.<P>pull a bmp image of your black car into photshop or some other PC drawing tool, and draw the roof in a different color.<P>  I was thinking the effect would really stand out on a white car, or yellow.<P>   oh wait, i know, mask off your black roof, and paint the rest of the car white (c%||||reg||1
